{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26993","headline":"奉和门下相公雨中寄裴给事 · 姚合","name":"奉和门下相公雨中寄裴给事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓起闲看雨，垂檐自滴堦。\n风清想林壑，云湿似江淮。\n石信浮沤重，泥从积藓埋。\n气消浓酒力，心助独吟怀。\n飒飒通琴韵，萧萧静竹斋。\n彩毫无限思，念与夕郎乖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}